{"availability":"available","full":"Lidiya-Bokona/SpenT","name":"SpenT","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":20,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-25T05:33:50Z","updated":"2026-01-03T09:36:43Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://spen-t.netlify.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://spen-t.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T07:12:42.623Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T07:12:42.623Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T07:12:42.623Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.378Z","stars":19,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T07:12:42.623Z","stars":20,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SpenT represents the philosophy that \"Time is Money.\" It is a powerful, static web application designed to help you track, manage, and optimize your daily time allocation effectively.","SpenT transforms the abstract concept of time into a tangible asset. By initializing everyday with a \"balance\" of 86,400 seconds (representing the seconds in a 24-hour day), users can actively \"spend\" or \"invest\" their time.","The application operates entirely client side, using LocalStorage to persist your data, ensuring your privacy and allowing for a seamless offline experience."],"features":["Dashboard: A central hub displaying your live \"Remaining Balance,\" \"Invested Time,\" and \"Wasted Time.\"","Smart Task Tracking: Log tasks as \"Good\" (Invested), \"Neutral,\" or \"Bad\" (Wasted/Expenses).","Live Analytics: Visualize your time distribution with dynamic charts and real time statistics.","Calendar View: Review your history and track consistency over time.","PDF Reporting: generated detailed reports of your time usage for accountability."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lidiya-Bokona/SpenT/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"918e35c775bcdd523dbabd45b920456505cb988ecfc434f6e47f64959fe3e3fa","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.462Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11: